piad.  With the boycott, the field was again restricted to six teams – the USA, Korea, China, Canada, Australia, and Yugoslavia.  The United States was led by Cheryl Miller, considered the greatest woman player to that time, and the sister of future NBA star, Reggie Miller.  Nobody pressed the American team, which won the final over Korea, 85-55, its closest game in the tournament."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button459462", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button459462').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Scoring Average"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Time Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Disqualifications"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Free Throws", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FT"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Free Throws %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Total Rebounds"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Assists"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Steals"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Turnovers", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TOV"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Blocked Shots", :cl